{"id":"bb189441ee00","path":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/career-stories/company/Fondazione AGIRE / Tecnopolo Ticino","lang":"en","title":"Career Stories","description":"Le Career Stories (CS) sono testimonianze di carriera di alumni dell’USI che lavorano in realtà professionali sia a livello nazionale sia internazionale. Visualizza le Career stories suddivise per Azienda Area funzione Nazione Programma di studio Facoltà Anno di laurea Cognome…","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","Alumni","Alumni portraits"],"image":null,"words":94,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/alumni/ritratti/career-stories","en":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/career-stories"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"Alumni","path":"/en/university/info/alumni"},{"label":"Alumni portraits","path":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits"},{"label":"Career Stories","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>The Career Stories present the career experiences of USI alumni (graduates) who have joined the workforce in the public or private sector, both at a national and at international level.</p> <p><strong>Read the Career Stories sorted by</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"/en/career-stories-organizations\">Company</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/career-stories/areas\">Function</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/career-stories/countries\">Country</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/career-stories-degree\">Degree</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/career-stories/faculties\">Faculty</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/career-stories-list-degree-year\">Graduation year</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/career-stories-last-name\">Last name</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/university/info/career/students-and-graduates/internship-stories\">Internship Stories</a></li> </ul><p>Would you like to tell us your ca